{"metadata":{"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"slug":[{"Plain":"陪集空间"},0],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"title":[{"Plain":"陪集空间"},2]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>对于群 $G$ 的子群 $H$, <strong>陪集空间</strong> $G / H$ 是 $G$ 关于 $H$ 的右乘"},{"Local":{"url":"群作用","text":"作用"}},{"Plain":"的商空间. 等价地, 它是如下的"},{"Local":{"url":"纤维列","text":"纤维"}},{"Plain":":\n$$\r\nG / H = \\operatorname{fib}(\\mathbf{B}H \\to \\mathbf{B}G)=\r\n{*} \\times_{\\mathbf{B}G} \\mathbf{B}H,\r\n$$\n也即 $G / H$ 是 $G$ 关于子群 $*$ 和 $H$ 的"},{"Local":{"url":"双陪集空间","text":"双陪集空间"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2>例</h2>\n<p>群 $G$ 关于其"},{"Local":{"url":"中心","text":"中心"}},{"Plain":" $Z(G)$ 的陪集空间是"},{"Local":{"url":"内自同构","text":"内自同构群"}},{"Plain":" $\\operatorname{Inn}(G)$.</p>\n"}]}}